  <!-- Headless twin of AFS_Desktop\autofilesync.vcxproj: the same core sources with
       the same vcpkg and Boost paths, compiled without the wxWidgets hooks
       (no _WXWIDGETS), as backgroundsync\CMakeLists.txt does with afs_core_headless.
       Its own output directory keeps the two projects' IncrementalClean steps apart;
       the runtime DLLs are copied in afterwards like the desktop program does. -->
